Comment: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------OPJP-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:47.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}今
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:57.02,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}叫べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:08.18,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}見つめてる　嘘ばかりの世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:13.04,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}描いてる　アイという暗闇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:18.30,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}心をなくしても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:22.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}君だけは守り抜く
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:26.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}明日酷い憎しみが
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.96,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}僕ら支配しようと
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}手を伸ばしてくんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:35.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}超えるべきな嘆きの嵐さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:38.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}許したくはない本性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:42.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}そんなのツライコワイ　知らないで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}（Please  take  the  magic）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:48.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}この傷が何時までも塞がらなくて痛んだって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:52.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}君の涙奪ってあげる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}（I  want  to  be  strong  for  you）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:57.64,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}決められた限界など壊してしまえ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:02.28,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}今
Comment: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------OPCN-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:47.20,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}此刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:57.02,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}呼喊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:08.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}注视着  充满虚假的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:13.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}描绘着  名为悲哀的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:18.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}哪怕失去心灵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:22.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}唯独你  我愿保护到底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:26.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}明日疯狂的憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}欲将你我支配
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}我也会伸出手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:35.84,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}应当逾越的悲叹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:38.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}无法原谅的本性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:42.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}这些痛苦恐惧  却不曾知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}（Please  take  the  magic）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:48.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}纵使这份伤痛无法愈合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:52.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}我也要为你抹去泪水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:53.17,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}（I  want  to  be  strong  for  you）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:57.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}冲破既定的界限
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:02.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}此刻
Comment: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDJP-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:30.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Do  you  see  the  light  ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:35.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Will  you  face  the  night  ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:38.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}So  far  away,  so  far  away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.31,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}（shining  ray）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:40.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Forever,  so  far  away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:41.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}（arising）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:43.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}So  far  away,  so  far  away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:44.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}（find  the  way）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:46.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Forever,  so  far  away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:47.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}（awakening）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:52.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}遠くの夜明けを見つめる瞳は希望に溢れた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:57.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}広がる暗闇のキャンバスに輝く虹を描いた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:23:00.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}LONG  WAY　たった一途の
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:03.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}NEW  DAY　たった１つの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.22,0:23:07.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}運命　貫いて　ただ夢追い続けた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:12.72,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}This  night,  the  stars  will  set  your  heart  free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:17.88,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Have  faith,  let  the  whole  world  know  what  you  see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:23.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}走り出す心が今迷わず進むように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:28.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}どこまでも道を行く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:34.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Beyond  the  night,  a  miracle  is  waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}Believe  in  the  fantasies  unfolding
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:45.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}求める未来がずっと色褪せないように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:49.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}いつまでも駆け抜ける
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:53.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fsp2.5\fad(150,150)}A  dream  beginning
